OL,3,GNEWSAMan who suffered three serious
OL,4,Aconditions hails NHS
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man from Kent who almost died after
OL,7,Fsuffering from three different
OL,8,Fconditions has hailed his "miracle"
OL,9,Fescape and says his experience "shows
OL,10,Fthe absolute peak of British
OL,11,Fhealthcare".
OL,13,FNigel Sanne, 69, survived sepsis, an
OL,14,Fallergic reaction, and a rare condition
OL,15,Fcalled Kounis syndrome after
OL,16,Fcomplications following abdominal
OL,17,Freconstruction surgery in London.
OL,19,FHe spent a month in Ashford's William
OL,20,FHarvey Hospital.
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,322,320,200,140,0,100
