OL,3,GNEWSAMan who suffered three serious
OL,4,Aconditions hails NHS
OL,5,
OL,6,F"My story is living proof of what it is
OL,7,Ftruly capable of when faced with
OL,8,Fseemingly overwhelming odds," he said.
